{"id":"637194","name":"泰式酸辣蛤蜊","author":"草莓","authorId":"19344","desc":"","cover":"images/637194/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"蛤蜊","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"30g"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"30g"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"5颗"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"30g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所需食材。","img":"images/637194/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蛤蜊洗净后倒入锅中，加适量冷水煮。","img":"images/637194/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮至蛤蜊开口后捞出沥干水分。","img":"images/637194/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把格力一片没有肉的壳掰掉，只留一片壳。","img":"images/637194/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入切碎的辣椒和蒜米。","img":"images/637194/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入切碎的香菜和小葱。","img":"images/637194/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入一袋泰式酸辣汁。","img":"images/637194/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/637194/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"也可以把鸡爪换成虾和鸡爪做也一样好吃开胃。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}